  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "AG10-VAL013-015-PENDING" ;
  triage:title "AG.10 secured-transport sprint has real-hardware validation rows AG-VAL-013 and AG-VAL-015 still pending, blocking release" ;
  triage:description "AG.10 QA Blocking finding: the secured-transport implementation's validation checklist rows AG-VAL-013 (secure LAN host-pair rerun) and AG-VAL-015 (secure routed/VPN host-pair rerun) remain PENDING and cannot be marked complete without actual cross-host hardware execution on real Windows and macOS systems. This is a status/tracking finding, not a code fix." ;
